    "secondary": "#6E6E6E",
    "accent": "#B9B9B9",
    "text": "light",
    "_why": "Used when a club has no verified palette. Deliberately neutral: a wrong colour is worse than no colour, and a grey counter-light still gives the composition depth without claiming anything about the opponent."
